HOW TO RUN EXPENSEPRO AI 2.0 (FINTECH DASHBOARD)
===================================================

Step 1: Open Terminal in Project Folder
cd "d:\pro 4\expense_tracker"

Step 2: Install Required Dependencies
python -m pip install flask flask_sqlalchemy flask_login reportlab openpyxl pandas

Step 3: Run the Application
python app.py

Step 4: Open in Your Browser
Visit: http://127.0.0.1:5000

Step 5: Quick Demo Access (Portfolio / Recruiter Mode)
- On the login screen, click the "1-Click Demo Login (Preloaded Data)" button.
- It will instantly log you in with preloaded transactions, charts, subscriptions, and split groups!
- Or click "Create Account" to test brand-new user registration.

KEY FEATURES TO DEMO:
• Real-Time AI Auto-Category: In 'Add Transaction', type "Swiggy burger" or "Uber cab" in the note field to see the AI badge predict the category instantly!
• OCR Receipt Scanner: Click "Scan Receipt" in the top bar to scan a bill.
• Bank CSV Import: Click "Import CSV" to upload bank statements.
• PDF & Excel Reports: Click "Export" -> "Download PDF Statement" or "Excel Report".
• Subscriptions: Check the "Recurring Subscriptions" tab for renewal countdowns.
• Splitwise: Check the "Group Split" tab for shared bill settlements.
